The Security Center business module (src/security.cjs) and its MCP tool
definitions (src/security-tools.cjs) are adapted from the owner's Atlas
repository, revision 227e897b68fbbaf2d6436084526519bf28ededf8.
They were extracted with standalone storage, identity, repository selection,
credentials and timezone configuration. No Atlas data or Git history is bundled.

The original server-rendered publications, glossary, expert registry, SVG charts,
connector dashboard and Security Center interface in src/native are adapted from
the same revision. The original Security Center base CSS and repository interactions
are retained, with an additional limited-analysis label in the browser script.
Identity, local persistence, URLs, CSRF and configurable category labels are adapted
for independent instances. No private Atlas publication or expert seeds are bundled.
The beta 3 agent setup, model bindings, job monitoring and sidebar personalization
are standalone extensions in this distribution.

